Failed sync retries on correct schedule confirmed
Z-Report triggers immediate sync attempt confirmed
USB export file is AES-256 encrypted and unreadable without key
USB export file imports correctly via dashboard upload endpoint
Imported data appears identical to normally synced data
Catch-up sync fires within 60 seconds of internet restoration
Catch-up sends data in chronological order confirmed
Sync status (sent/pending/failed) broadcast to dashboard via Reverb
